-- title:
--   OAI.SharpPlanar.IntegerBasis.exp_direct_step_e: intermediate lemma from OpenAI, A sharp Fourier certificate for planar circle packing (result family 090)
-- statement:
--   An intermediate lemma of the split of OpenAI's proof of `OAI.sharp_fourier_certificate`, carved from OpenAI's openai/math development for this platform. The statement and its proof are OpenAI's (OpenAI, *A sharp Fourier certificate for planar circle packing (result family 090)*, OpenAI Math Release, September 23, 2026, result family 90, [github.com/openai/math](https://github.com/openai/math), Apache License 2.0); in Lean it is the declaration `OAI.SharpPlanar.IntegerBasis.exp_direct_step` of [lean/OAI/Analysis/PlanarPacking/BasisIntervals.lean](https://github.com/openai/math/blob/7ef5c0cc5ca4b0e072b7a050fca09ab24bc6fa3a/lean/OAI/Analysis/PlanarPacking/BasisIntervals.lean) at commit 7ef5c0c, ported to Lean 4.33.1 and Mathlib 0df444a.
--
--   **The statement**, as published (namespace `OAI.SharpPlanar.IntegerBasis`, with `open IntegerIntervals`):
--
--   ```lean
--   lemma exp_direct_step_e {p q : CBox} {t : ℝ} {n : ℕ}
--       (hp : p.Contains (Complex.exp (-Complex.I*Real.pi*t*n)))
--       (hq : q.Contains (Complex.exp (-Complex.I*Real.pi*t))) :
--       (p.mul q).Contains (Complex.exp (-Complex.I*Real.pi*t*(n+1)))
--   ```
--
--   **Definitions.** The statement is written with `OAI.SharpPlanar.IntegerIntervals.CBox` and `OAI.SharpPlanar.IntegerIntervals.CBox.mul` (definitions bundle `OAIQ098E017` of this split); `OAI.SharpPlanar.IntegerIntervals.CBox.Contains` (definitions bundle `OAIQ098E031` of this split).
